---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { addressLine, site } from '../data/site';

const updated = 'November 5, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Terms & Conditions - Goat Garage Door Service"
	description="The terms for using the Goat Garage Door Service website and for requesting residential garage door repair or installation in Fishers, IN."
>
	<PageHero
		title="Terms & Conditions"
		lead="How this website works, and what a request for service means."
		crumbs={[
			{ label: 'Home', href: '/' },
			{ label: 'Terms & Conditions' },
		]}
	/>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container prose" style="max-width: 760px;">
			<p><strong>Last Updated: {updated}</strong></p>

			<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
			<p>Welcome to {site.name} ("we", "our", or "us").</p>
			<p>
				These Terms &amp; Conditions govern your access to and use of our website, located at
				<a href={site.domain}>{site.domain}</a>.
			</p>
			<p>
				By accessing or using this website, you agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree with these terms,
				please discontinue using the website.
			</p>
			<p>
				These terms apply to your use of the website and its content. Any separate agreement for services requested or provided
				by our business may be subject to additional terms and conditions.
			</p>

			<h2>2. Use of Website</h2>
			<p>
				You agree to use this website only for lawful purposes and in a manner that does not violate applicable laws, infringe
				the rights of others, or interfere with another person's ability to access and use the website.
			</p>
			<p>You must not:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Use the website for fraudulent, unlawful, or misleading activities.</li>
				<li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the website, its server, or related systems.</li>
				<li>Distribute malicious software, harmful code, or other content that may damage the website or its users.</li>
				<li>Interfere with the website's operation, security, or availability.</li>
				<li>Copy, reproduce, or misuse website content without appropriate authorization.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We reserve the right to restrict or suspend access to the website if we reasonably believe someone is violating these
				Terms &amp; Conditions or misusing the website.
			</p>

			<h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
			<p>
				Unless otherwise stated, the content available on this website, including text, images, graphics, logos, branding,
				design elements, and other materials, belongs to {site.name} or is used with appropriate permission.
			</p>
			<p>This content is protected by applicable intellectual property laws.</p>
			<p>You may access and view website content for personal and informational purposes.</p>
			<p>
				You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, republish, commercially exploit, or otherwise use website content without
				prior written permission from the appropriate rights holder, unless permitted by law.
			</p>
			<p>All third-party names, trademarks, and logos appearing on this website remain the property of their respective owners.</p>

			<h2>4. User Content</h2>
			<p>
				If our website allows you to submit comments, reviews, messages, photographs, or other content, you are responsible for
				the material you provide.
			</p>
			<p>You agree that submitted content will not:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Violate applicable laws or regulations.</li>
				<li>Infringe another person's intellectual property or privacy rights.</li>
				<li>Contain fraudulent, misleading, abusive, or defamatory material.</li>
				<li>Include malicious software or harmful links.</li>
				<li>Be used to harass, threaten, or harm others.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>By submitting content, you confirm that you have the necessary rights and permissions to provide it.</p>
			<p>
				We reserve the right to review, remove, or restrict access to submitted content that violates these terms or is
				otherwise inappropriate.
			</p>

			<h2>5. Links to Other Websites</h2>
			<p>
				Our website may contain links to third-party websites, services, maps, videos, or other external content for convenience
				and informational purposes.
			</p>
			<p>These external websites are operated independently and may have their own terms, privacy policies, and practices.</p>
			<p>
				We do not control or take responsibility for the content, availability, accuracy, security, or privacy practices of
				third-party websites.
			</p>
			<p>
				Accessing external websites through links on our website is at your own discretion. We recommend reviewing the applicable
				terms and privacy policies of those websites.
			</p>

			<h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
			<p>
				We make reasonable efforts to keep our website information accurate and available. However, we do not guarantee that the
				website will always be accessible, uninterrupted, error-free, or free from harmful components.
			</p>
			<p>
				Information provided on this website is intended for general informational purposes. Website content should not be treated
				as a substitute for an inspection, professional assessment, written estimate, or separate service agreement.
			</p>
			<p>
				To the extent permitted by applicable law, {site.name} will not be liable for losses or damages arising directly from
				your access to or inability to use the website, reliance on general website information, or use of third-party websites
				linked from our pages.
			</p>
			<p>
				Nothing in these Terms &amp; Conditions excludes or limits liability where such exclusion or limitation is prohibited by
				applicable law.
			</p>

			<h2>7. Changes to Terms</h2>
			<p>
				We may update or revise these Terms &amp; Conditions from time to time to reflect changes to our website, business
				practices, or applicable requirements.
			</p>
			<p>
				When changes are made, the revised terms will be published on this page and the Last Updated date will be updated
				accordingly.
			</p>
			<p>
				Your continued use of the website after revised terms are published indicates your acceptance of the updated Terms &amp;
				Conditions.
			</p>
			<p>We encourage visitors to review this page periodically.</p>

			<h2>8. Governing Law</h2>
			<p>
				These Terms &amp; Conditions are governed by the laws applicable to the State of Indiana, United States, without regard
				to conflict-of-law principles, to the extent permitted by applicable law.
			</p>
			<p>
				Any disputes relating to the use of this website will be handled in accordance with the applicable laws and legal
				requirements of the relevant jurisdiction.
			</p>

			<h2>9. Contact</h2>
			<p>
				If you have questions about these Terms &amp; Conditions or need further information regarding the use of our website,
				please contact us:
			</p>
			<p><strong>Business Name:</strong> {site.name}</p>
			<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href={site.domain}>{site.domain}</a></p>
			<p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
			<p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href={`tel:${site.phoneTel}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a></p>
			<p><strong>Business Address:</strong> {addressLine}</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
